# runsvdir/default/ - Service symlinks for default runlevel
#
# Design:
# - kmscon-tty1..tty6 are the primary DRM-backed consoles
# - tty1 auto-logs in the live user and starts tui-session
# - tty2..tty6 show standard login prompts (root access preserved)
# - agetty-tty1..tty6 are disabled via runit 'down' markers
#
# Each kmscon-ttyN service calls the shared /etc/sv/kmscon/run script
# using its VT number. The shared settings select KMSCON's built-in
# Unifont font engine so text has a usable fixed-width cell grid.
# Normally KMSCON failure falls back to agetty; /etc/default/tui-kmscon-only
# disables that fallback for strict KMSCON-only builds.